WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.606
Digital tools help you plan faster, and reuse good lessons.

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:07.726
Start with the objective: what learners will be able to do.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:11.569
Then a starter, the main activity, and a way to check learning.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.618
Save it once as a template, and copy it for each lesson.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:18.914
Share a folder with colleagues, and divide the work.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:28.202
Before you move on, check: Create a lesson plan template. Plan one lesson with it. Share a planning folder with a colleague.

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:32.680
In the next lesson: Teaching online safety.
